tinue_watching_progress":0},{"items":[],"id":39389,"title":"ورود وذنوب  مدبلج","description":"","card_type":"normalPoster","type":"SERIES","url":"","style":{"image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/229d945f-27d9-4108-b63b-9fa8690601e8.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":20640,"title":"","description":"26","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"id":20640,"type":"SERIES","title":"مد وجزر - Medcezir","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk43/seasons/6aef9bdb-c724-495a-a843-268f291166e3.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk48/seasons/4c2ef5de-7fd7-4bdf-a7e6-33e18ae57e38.jpg","likes":489,"dislikes":13,"views":160874,"release_date":"1379030400000","season_number":1,"description":"Yaman, who lives in the suburb of Istanbul Tozludere, gets into trouble because of his big brother. Until that day he tried to change his destiny by working to be a good student. That evening he will unwillingly be introduced to crime. And his clean dossier is tainted. He meets lawyer Selim Serez when he has lost all the hope. Selim sees in Yaman a promising young man, under the mud that is over him. Yaman who gets into trouble even more while trying to stay out of it, reminds him of himself and doesn't want this guy's story to end behind iron bars Yaman doesn't take seriously the offer of a rich lawyer at first, but after problems that surface after his return to his house, her realizes he won't be able to continue his life where he left it. Loud voices from the poor house once again reach Selim. Yaman doesn't refuse Selim's offer this time and he takes a new step towards the door that lead to a new world offered to him by a man whom he met under bad circumstances. Even if Yaman is aware that there are no miracles in real life, and that he doesn't have another chance apart from going through that door. Carrying the weight of past on his shoulders, among people he doesn't know, he will face a more difficult life than the one he had in Tozludere.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.9}],"value":6.9,"age":"N/A"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":9652,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}